{"unit_id":"tag:0D6E:proof","translation":"由引理 <REF_0001>，可见 <MATH_0001> 伴随于（adjoint）<MATH_0002>。由引理 <REF_0002>，有 <MATH_0003>；因而由伴随函子（adjoint functors）的唯一性（uniqueness），有 <MATH_0004>。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"adjoint","target_term":"伴随于"},{"source_term":"adjoint functors","target_term":"伴随函子"},{"source_term":"uniqueness","target_term":"唯一性"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"adjoint","target_term":"伴随于","context":"复合伴随关系"},{"source_term":"adjoint functors","target_term":"伴随函子","context":"通过伴随唯一性识别函子"},{"source_term":"uniqueness","target_term":"唯一性","context":"伴随函子唯一性"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:07A7:statement","translation":"无界（unbounded）导出函子（derived functor）<MATH_0001> 和 <MATH_0002> 的构造，使我们能在完全一般的情形下构造基变换（base change）映射（map）。具体而言，假设\n<MATH_0003>\n为赋环拓扑斯（ringed topoi）的交换图式（commutative diagram）。设 <MATH_0004> 为 <MATH_0005> 的对象（object）。则存在典范的（canonical）基变换（base change）映射（map）\n<MATH_0006>\n在 <MATH_0007> 中。具体而言，此映射（map）伴随于（adjoint）映射（map）<MATH_0008>。由于 <MATH_0009>，可见这等同于映射（map）<MATH_0010>，可取它为 <MATH_0011> 作用于伴随（adjunction）映射（map）<MATH_0012> 所得。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"unbounded","target_term":"无界"},{"source_term":"derived functor","target_term":"导出函子"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基变换"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"ringed topoi","target_term":"赋环拓扑斯"},{"source_term":"commutative diagram","target_term":"交换图式"},{"source_term":"object","target_term":"对象"},{"source_term":"canonical","target_term":"典范的"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基变换"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"adjoint","target_term":"伴随于"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"adjunction","target_term":"伴随"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"unbounded","target_term":"无界","context":"导出函子的适用范围"},{"source_term":"derived functor","target_term":"导出函子","context":"无界导出构造"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基变换","context":"基变换比较"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射","context":"基变换及其伴随映射"},{"source_term":"ringed topoi","target_term":"赋环拓扑斯","context":"图式对象"},{"source_term":"commutative diagram","target_term":"交换图式","context":"基变换图式"},{"source_term":"object","target_term":"对象","context":"导出范畴对象"},{"source_term":"canonical","target_term":"典范的","context":"基变换映射性质"},{"source_term":"adjoint","target_term":"伴随于","context":"确定基变换映射的伴随关系"},{"source_term":"adjunction","target_term":"伴随","context":"伴随映射"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:0E46:statement","translation":"考虑交换图式（commutative diagram）\n<MATH_0001>\n其对象为赋环拓扑斯（ringed topoi）。则注记 <REF_0001> 中两个方块（squares）的基变换（base change）映射（maps）复合（compose），给出外部矩形（rectangle）的基变换（base change）映射（map）。更准确地，复合（composition）\n<MATH_0002>\n是该矩形（rectangle）的基变换（base change）映射（map）。我们省略核实。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"commutative diagram","target_term":"交换图式"},{"source_term":"ringed topoi","target_term":"赋环拓扑斯"},{"source_term":"squares","target_term":"方块"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基变换"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"compose","target_term":"复合"},{"source_term":"rectangle","target_term":"矩形"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基变换"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"composition","target_term":"复合"},{"source_term":"rectangle","target_term":"矩形"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基变换"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"commutative diagram","target_term":"交换图式","context":"两个方块组成的图式"},{"source_term":"ringed topoi","target_term":"赋环拓扑斯","context":"图式对象"},{"source_term":"squares","target_term":"方块","context":"图式的两个方块"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基变换","context":"复合基变换"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映射","context":"两个基变换映射"},{"source_term":"compose","target_term":"复合","context":"基变换映射复合"},{"source_term":"rectangle","target_term":"矩形","context":"图式的外部矩形"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射","context":"外部矩形的比较映射"},{"source_term":"composition","target_term":"复合","context":"比较映射复合"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:0E47:statement","translation":"考虑交换图式（commutative diagram）\n<MATH_0001>\n其对象为赋环拓扑斯（ringed topoi）。则注记 <REF_0001> 中两个方块（squares）的基变换（base change）映射（maps）复合（compose），给出外部矩形（rectangle）的基变换（base change）映射（map）。更准确地，复合（composition）\n<MATH_0002>\n是该矩形（rectangle）的基变换（base change）映射（map）。我们省略核实。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"commutative diagram","target_term":"交换图式"},{"source_term":"ringed topoi","target_term":"赋环拓扑斯"},{"source_term":"squares","target_term":"方块"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基变换"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"compose","target_term":"复合"},{"source_term":"rectangle","target_term":"矩形"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基变换"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"composition","target_term":"复合"},{"source_term":"rectangle","target_term":"矩形"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基变换"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"commutative diagram","target_term":"交换图式","context":"两个方块组成的图式"},{"source_term":"ringed topoi","target_term":"赋环拓扑斯","context":"图式对象"},{"source_term":"squares","target_term":"方块","context":"图式的两个方块"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基变换","context":"复合基变换"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映射","context":"两个基变换映射"},{"source_term":"compose","target_term":"复合","context":"基变换映射复合"},{"source_term":"rectangle","target_term":"矩形","context":"图式的外部矩形"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射","context":"外部矩形的比较映射"},{"source_term":"composition","target_term":"复合","context":"比较映射复合"}],"notes":[]}
